		You submit to being bound with your heart hammering in your chest. <<person2>> The <<person>> ties your arms together behind your back while the <<person1>><<person>> watches with a sardonic smile. It takes almost no time at all. When you test the ropes, your wrists refuse to budge, and a helpless little tremor runs through you.
	<<case "shy">>
		You let them bind you, too rattled to do much but stand still and endure it. <<person2>> The <<person>> secures your arms behind your back while the <<person1>><<person>> looks on in clear amusement. The finished knots leave your hands twitching uselessly behind you, and the helplessness of it sinks in at once.
	<<case "polite">>
		You submit with strained composure. <<person2>> The <<person>> draws your arms behind your back and ties them neatly while the <<person1>><<person>> watches with an irritatingly pleased smile. Once finished, you try your bonds and discover just how thoroughly trapped you are.
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		You submit with as much dignity as the situation allows, though the effect is rather spoiled by your arms being drawn behind your back. <<person2>> The <<person>> ties you efficiently while the <<person1>><<person>> enjoys the spectacle. By the time they are done, even your smallest movement only makes your restraint feel more obvious.
	<<case "docile">>
		You submit without protest. <<person2>> The <<person>> ties your arms behind your back while the <<person1>><<person>> watches with a satisfied smile. The work is quick and practiced, and when you test your arms afterwards, all you earn for it is a deeper sense of helplessness.
	<<case "confident">>
		You make them work for your obedience by holding yourself taut and steady, but you still submit. <<person2>> The <<person>> binds your arms behind your back while the <<person1>><<person>> watches with a smug smile. Once finished, you test the cables and discover confidence does very little when your hands are trapped behind you.
	<<case "bratty">>
		You submit with a resentful glare, making no effort to hide how much you hate giving them what they want. <<person2>> The <<person>> ties your arms behind your back while the <<person1>><<person>> watches with an infuriatingly smug smile. When you yank against the finished binding, all you manage is a useless flail and a fresh surge of helpless anger.
	<<case "cruel">>
		You submit stiffly, your expression colder than your situation deserves. <<person2>> The <<person>> secures your arms behind your back while the <<person1>><<person>> looks on with open satisfaction. You test the restraint once, find it firm, and hate how completely it strips away your leverage.
	<<default>>
		You submit to being bound. <<person2>> The <<person>> ties your arms together behind your back while the <<person1>><<person>> looks on, a sardonic smile on <<his>> face. It doesn't take long; the <<person2>><<person>> soon stands back to admire <<his>> handiwork. You try to move your arms, but they are tied together tightly. You can only wave them impotently behind your back. Feelings of helplessness rise within you.
